<title>USA: U.S. aluminum stocks lower in July- ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. aluminum stocks lower in July- ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. aluminum stocks held by integrated and non-integrated producers and smelters including scrap, ingot, metal in-process and finished products fell to 2,157,000 short tons in July from 2,178,000 short tons in June, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Primary production rose to 332,000 short tons in July from 323,000 short tons in June.</p>
<p>Net shipments were 787,000 short tons in July versus 806,000 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
